{"path":"numeric/bit/endian","title":"__STDC_ENDIAN_LITTLE__, __STDC_ENDIAN_BIG__, __STDC_ENDIAN_NATIVE__","titleHtml":"__STDC_ENDIAN_LITTLE__, __STDC_ENDIAN_BIG__, __STDC_ENDIAN_NATIVE__","originalUrl":"https://en.cppreference.com/w/c/numeric/bit/endian","section":"numeric","kind":"page","summary":"Indicates the endianness of all scalar types:","html":"<table class=\"t-dcl-begin\"><tbody>\n<tr class=\"t-dsc-header\">\n<td> <div>Defined in header <code><a href=\"/w/c/numeric#Bit_manipulation\"><code>&lt;stdbit.h&gt;</code></a></code>\n </div></td>\n<td></td>\n<td></td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c23\" id=\"Version_1\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"co2\">#define __STDC_ENDIAN_LITTLE__ /* implementation-defined */</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (1) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(since C23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c23\" id=\"Version_2\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"co2\">#define __STDC_ENDIAN_BIG__ &nbsp; &nbsp;/* implementation-defined */</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (2) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(since C23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl t-since-c23\" id=\"Version_3\">\n<td> <div><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\"><span class=\"co2\">#define __STDC_ENDIAN_NATIVE__ /* implementation-defined */</span></span></div></td>\n<td> (3) </td>\n<td> <span class=\"t-mark-rev t-since-c23\">(since C23)</span> </td>\n</tr>\n<tr class=\"t-dcl-sep\"><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>Indicates the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Endianness#Overview\" class=\"extiw\" data-external=\"1\">endianness</a> of all <a href=\"/w/cpp/language/type\">scalar types</a>:\n</p>\n<ul><li> If all scalar types are little-endian, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">__STDC_ENDIAN_NATIVE__</span></code> equals <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">__STDC_ENDIAN_LITTLE__</span></code>.\n</li><li> If all scalar types are big-endian, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">__STDC_ENDIAN_NATIVE__</span></code> equals <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">__STDC_ENDIAN_BIG__</span></code>.\n</li><li> If the platform uses neither little-endian nor big-endian, <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">__STDC_ENDIAN_NATIVE__</span></code> equals neither <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">__STDC_ENDIAN_BIG__</span></code> nor <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">__STDC_ENDIAN_LITTLE__</span></code>.\n</li><li> The values of the integer constant expressions for <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">__STDC_ENDIAN_BIG__</span></code> and <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi c source-c\">__STDC_ENDIAN_LITTLE__</span></code> are not equal.\n</li></ul>\n<h3 id=\"Example\">Example</h3>\n<div class=\"t-example\">\n<pre data-lang=\"c\"><code><span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdbit.h&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"co2\">#include &lt;stdio.h&gt;</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">switch</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span>__STDC_ENDIAN_NATIVE__<span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> __STDC_ENDIAN_LITTLE__<span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw851\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"__STDC_ENDIAN_LITTLE__<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">break</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">case</span> __STDC_ENDIAN_BIG__<span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw851\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"__STDC_ENDIAN_BIG__<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n            <span class=\"kw1\">break</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n        <span class=\"kw1\">default</span><span class=\"sy4\">:</span>\n            <a href=\"/w/c/io/fprintf\"><span class=\"kw851\">printf</span></a><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"st0\">\"mixed-endian<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n    <span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n    <span class=\"kw1\">return</span> __STDC_ENDIAN_NATIVE__<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Possible output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>mixed-endian</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td colspan=\"2\"> <div class=\"t-dsc-see\"><span><a href=\"/w/cpp/types/endian\">C++ documentation</a></span> for <span class=\"t-dsc-see-tt\"><span>endian</span></span></div>\n</td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C reference"},{"path":"numeric","title":"Numerics"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"__STDC_ENDIAN_LITTLE__, __STDC_ENDIAN_BIG__, __STDC_ENDIAN_NATIVE__","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"3 declarations. Indicates the endianness of all scalar types:"},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also"}]},"standards":["C23"],"wordCount":114,"codeBlockCount":2}
